{"id":"11fd10af8589af8504ed18ec4c0b4a5c985e2d22","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"11fd10af8589af8504ed18ec4c0b4a5c985e2d22","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/engines-beside-platform.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@","+---","+\"@pnpm/cli.utils\": patch","+\"pnpm\": patch","+---","+","+`pnpm install` now fails on a workspace project's incompatible `engines.pnpm`, or on its incompatible `engines.node` with `engineStrict` enabled, even when the project's `os`, `cpu`, or `libc` excludes the current platform [pnpm/tasks#281](https://github.com/pnpm/tasks/issues/281)."],"additions":6,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":".changeset/every-project-engines.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"pacquet\": patch","+---","+","+`pnpm install` now checks the `engines`, `os`, `cpu`, and `libc` fields of every workspace project, not only the workspace root. A project's incompatible `engines.pnpm` fails the install. An incompatible `engines.node` prints a warning, or fails the install with `engineStrict` enabled. An unsupported platform prints a warning [pnpm/tasks#281](https://github.com/pnpm/tasks/issues/281)."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/install/fast_path.rs","lines":["@@ -31,6 +31,28 @@ fn warn_about_config(","     warn_deprecated_override_version_references(config, emit);"," }"," ","+/// Check what the projects `up_to_date` covers require of the host, as the","+/// install does. The root project is checked here only before the config","+/// setup, which checks it otherwise. Returns the warnings about the other","+/// projects, so that a declined fast path emits none of them.","+fn check_host_requirements(","+    manifest_path: &std::path::Path,","+    config: &pnpm_config::Config,","+    up_to_date: &pnpm_package_manager::UpToDateWorkspace,","+    attempt: Attempt,","+    emit: fn(&pnpm_reporter::LogEvent),","+) -> Result<Vec<pnpm_reporter::LogEvent>, &'static str> {","+    let root_dir = crate::state::root_project_dir(manifest_path, config);","+    let project_warnings = crate::state::ProjectHost::new(config, root_dir)","+        .check_projects(&up_to_date.host_requirements)","+        .map_err(|_| \"a workspace project's host requirements are not met\")?;","+    if matches!(attempt, Attempt::BeforeConfig) {","+        crate::state::check_root_project_engine(manifest_path, config, emit)","+            .map_err(|_| \"root project engine check failed\")?;","+    }","+    Ok(project_warnings)","+}","+"," fn report_up_to_date_install(","     config: &pnpm_config::Config,","     up_to_date: &pnpm_package_manager::UpToDateWorkspace,","@@ -211,16 +233,12 @@ impl InstallArgs {","                 config.supported_architectures.clone(),","             ),","         })?;","+        let project_warnings =","+            check_host_requirements(&manifest_path, config, &up_to_date, attempt, emit)?;","         if matches!(attempt, Attempt::BeforeConfig) {","-            crate::state::check_root_project_engine(","-                &manifest_path,","-                config,","-                !config.skip_runtimes,","-                emit,","-            )","-            .map_err(|_| \"root project engine check failed\")?;","             warn_about_config(root_manifest.as_ref(), config, emit);","         }","+        project_warnings.iter().for_each(emit);","         report_up_to_date_install(config, &up_to_date, emit);","         Ok(())","     }"],"additions":25,"deletions":7,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/pipelines.rs","lines":["@@ -104,14 +104,6 @@ enum RuntimePolicy {","     Config(bool),"," }"," ","-impl RuntimePolicy {","-    fn use_manifest(self, config: &Config) -> bool {","-        match self {","-            Self::Config(no_runtime) => !(config.skip_runtimes || no_runtime),","-        }","-    }","-}","-"," async fn prepare_root_config<Reporter>(","     (manifest_path, config, config_root): (&Path, &mut Config, &Path),","     (frozen_lockfile, runtime_policy): (bool, RuntimePolicy),","@@ -127,20 +119,10 @@ where","         .as_ref()","         .is_some_and(|dependencies| !dependencies.is_empty());","     if !may_update_config && !has_config_dependencies && config.engine_strict {","-        check_root_project_engine(","-            manifest_path,","-            config,","-            runtime_policy.use_manifest(config),","-            Reporter::emit,","-        )?;","+        check_root_project_engine(manifest_path, config, Reporter::emit)?;","     }","     config_deps::prepare::<Reporter>(config, config_root, frozen_lockfile).await?;","-    check_root_project_engine(","-        manifest_path,","-        config,","-        runtime_policy.use_manifest(config),","-        Reporter::emit,","-    )?;","+    check_root_project_engine(manifest_path, config, Reporter::emit)?;","     Ok(())"," }"," "],"additions":2,"deletions":20,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/pipelines/selection.rs","lines":["@@ -7,9 +7,12 @@ use super::{","     nested_workspace_manifests::report_nested_workspace_manifests, precomputed_workspace_cycles,","     project_dependencies, sequence_project_dependencies,"," };","-use crate::cli_args::recursive::{","-    AutoExcludeRoot, RecursiveSelection, UnmatchedFilters, discover_workspace_projects,","-    select_recursive_projects_deferring_no_match,","+use crate::{","+    cli_args::recursive::{","+        AutoExcludeRoot, RecursiveSelection, UnmatchedFilters, discover_workspace_projects,","+        select_recursive_projects_deferring_no_match,","+    },","+    state::ProjectHost,"," };"," use indexmap::IndexMap;"," use pnpm_config::Config;","@@ -92,6 +95,7 @@ pub(super) fn select_install_family<Reporter: self::Reporter>(","         return Ok(InstallFamily { plan: InstallFamilyPlan::Single, scope: None, unmatched: None });","     };","     let NarrowedWorkspace { selection, unmatched, root_selector } = narrowed;","+    check_project_requirements::<Reporter>(cfg, &selection)?;","     // Only an install another ecosystem takes part in reads the scope. The","     // npm install reads the selection itself, so it pays nothing for this.","     let scope = crate::ecosystem_install::is_enabled(cfg)","@@ -130,6 +134,26 @@ pub(super) fn select_install_family<Reporter: self::Reporter>(","     Ok(InstallFamily { plan, scope, unmatched })"," }"," ","+/// Check what every workspace project, selected or not, requires of the","+/// host, per [`ProjectHost`].","+fn check_project_requirements<Reporter: self::Reporter>(","+    cfg: &Config,","+    selection: &InstallFamilySelection,","+) -> miette::Result<()> {","+    let requirements: Vec<_> = selection.projects","+        .iter()","+        .filter_map(|project| {","+            pnpm_deps_restorer::project_host_requirements(project.manifest.value())","+                .map(|requirements| (project.root_dir.clone(), requirements))","+        })","+        .collect();","+    let host = ProjectHost::new(cfg, &selection.workspace_root);","+    for warning in host.check_projects(&requirements)? {","+        Reporter::emit(&warning);","+    }","+    Ok(())","+}","+"," pub(crate) fn select_workspace_projects(","     cfg: &Config,","     prefix: &Path,"],"additions":27,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/state.rs","lines":["@@ -1,18 +1,18 @@","+pub(crate) use project_installability::ProjectHost;","+"," use derive_more::{Display, Error};"," use miette::Diagnostic;"," use pipe_trait::Pipe;","-use pnpm_config::{Config, PNPM_VERSION};","+use pnpm_config::Config;"," use pnpm_lockfile::{LazyLockfile, MaybeLazyLockfile};"," use pnpm_network::{ForInstallsError, ThrottledClient};","-use pnpm_package_is_installable::{Engine, InstallabilityError, WantedEngine, check_engine};","+use pnpm_package_is_installable::InstallabilityError;"," use pnpm_package_manager::{","     CommandLockfile, DedicatedProjectInstall, ResolvedPackages, SharedInstallCaches,","     WorkspaceDependenciesInstalled,"," };","-use pnpm_package_manifest::{","-    PackageManifest, PackageManifestError, node_version_from_engines_runtime,","-};","-use pnpm_reporter::{GlobalLog, LogEvent, LogLevel};","+use pnpm_package_manifest::{PackageManifest, PackageManifestError};","+use pnpm_reporter::LogEvent;"," use pnpm_tarball::MemCache;"," use std::{","     path::{Path, PathBuf},","@@ -292,85 +292,37 @@ fn apply_runtime_on_fail(mut manifest: PackageManifest, config: &Config) -> Pack","     manifest"," }"," ","-/// Check the root project's `engines.node` and `engines.pnpm`. An","-/// unsatisfied `engines.pnpm` always fails. An unsatisfied `engines.node`","-/// fails under `engineStrict` and is a warning otherwise.","+/// Check what the root project requires of the host, per","+/// [`project_installability`]."," pub(crate) fn check_root_project_engine(","     manifest_path: &Path,","     config: &Config,","-    use_manifest_runtime: bool,","     emit: fn(&LogEvent),"," ) -> Result<(), InitStateError> {","-    let project_dir = config.workspace_dir","-        .as_deref()","-        .unwrap_or_else(|| manifest_path.parent().expect(\"manifest path always has a parent dir\"));","+    let project_dir = root_project_dir(manifest_path, config);","     let Some((_, manifest)) = pnpm_workspace::try_read_project_manifest(project_dir)","         .map_err(InitStateError::ManifestRead)?","     else {","         return Ok(());","     };","-    let Some(engines) = manifest.value().get(\"engines\") else {","+    let Some(requirements) = pnpm_deps_restorer::project_host_requirements(manifest.value()) else {","         return Ok(());","     };","-    let wanted = WantedEngine {","-        node: engines","-            .get(\"node\")","-            .and_then(serde_json::Value::as_str)","-            .map(str::to_string),","-        pnpm: engines","-            .get(\"pnpm\")","-            .and_then(serde_json::Value::as_str)","-            .map(str::to_string),","-    };","-    if wanted.node.is_none() && wanted.pnpm.is_none() {","-        return Ok(());","-    }","-    check_root_engine_compatibility(","-        project_dir,","-        manifest.value(),","-        config,","-        use_manifest_runtime,","-        &wanted,","-        emit,","-    )","+    let host = ProjectHost::new(config, project_dir);","+    host.check(project_dir, &requirements)?","+        .iter()","+        .for_each(emit);","+    Ok(())"," }"," ","-fn check_root_engine_compatibility(","-    project_dir: &Path,","-    manifest: &serde_json::Value,","-    config: &Config,","-    use_manifest_runtime: bool,","-    wanted: &WantedEngine,","-    emit: fn(&LogEvent),","-) -> Result<(), InitStateError> {","-    let configured_node = config.node_version","-        .clone()","-        .or_else(|| {","-            use_manifest_runtime.then(|| node_version_from_engines_runtime(manifest)).flatten()","-        });","-    let host =","-        pnpm_deps_restorer::InstallabilityHost::detect_with(config.engine_strict, configured_node);","-    let current = Engine {","-        node: host.node_version,","-        pnpm: wanted.pnpm.as_ref().map(|_| PNPM_VERSION.to_string()),","-    };","-    match check_engine(&project_dir.to_string_lossy(), wanted, &current) {","-        Ok(None) => Ok(()),","-        Ok(Some(error)) if config.engine_strict || error.wanted.pnpm.is_some() => {","-            Err(InitStateError::Installability(Box::new(InstallabilityError::Engine(error))))","-        }","-        Ok(Some(error)) => {","-            emit(&LogEvent::Global(GlobalLog {","-                level: LogLevel::Warn,","-                message: error.to_string(),","-            }));","-            Ok(())","-        }","-        Err(error) => Err(InitStateError::Installability(Box::new(","-            InstallabilityError::InvalidNodeVersion(error),","-        ))),","-    }","+/// The directory of the project [`check_root_project_engine`] checks.","+pub(crate) fn root_project_dir<'a>(manifest_path: &'a Path, config: &'a Config) -> &'a Path {","+    config.workspace_dir","+        .as_deref()","+        .unwrap_or_else(|| manifest_path.parent().expect(\"manifest path always has a parent dir\"))"," }"," ","+mod project_installability;","+"," #[cfg(test)]"," mod tests;"],"additions":22,"deletions":70,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/state/project_installability.rs","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,136 @@","+//! The check of what a project's own manifest requires of the host: its","+//! `engines.node`, `engines.pnpm`, `os`, `cpu`, and `libc`.","+//!","+//! - An unsatisfied `engines.pnpm` fails.","+//! - An unsatisfied `engines.node` fails under `engineStrict` and is a","+//!   warning otherwise.","+//! - An unsupported platform is a warning.","+","+use super::InitStateError;","+use pnpm_config::{Config, PNPM_VERSION};","+use pnpm_package_is_installable::{","+    InstallabilityError, InstallabilityOptions, PackageInstallabilityManifest, check_package,","+};","+use pnpm_package_manifest::node_version_from_engines_runtime;","+use pnpm_reporter::{GlobalLog, LogEvent, LogLevel};","+use std::{","+    cell::OnceCell,","+    path::{Path, PathBuf},","+};","+","+/// The host the projects of one install are checked against.","+pub(crate) struct ProjectHost<'a> {","+    config: &'a Config,","+    root_dir: &'a Path,","+    /// Detected for the first project that declares `engines.node`.","+    node_version: OnceCell<String>,","+}","+","+impl<'a> ProjectHost<'a> {","+    /// `root_dir` holds the manifest whose `engines.runtime` sets the","+    /// Node.js version when runtimes are not skipped and no `nodeVersion` is","+    /// configured.","+    pub(crate) fn new(config: &'a Config, root_dir: &'a Path) -> Self {","+        ProjectHost { config, root_dir, node_version: OnceCell::new() }","+    }","+","+    fn node_version(&self) -> &str {","+        self.node_version.get_or_init(|| {","+            let configured =","+                self.config.node_version.clone().or_else(|| self.root_runtime_node_version());","+            pnpm_deps_restorer::InstallabilityHost::detect_with(","+                self.config.engine_strict,","+                configured,","+            )","+            .node_version","+        })","+    }","+","+    fn root_runtime_node_version(&self) -> Option<String> {","+        if self.config.skip_runtimes {","+            return None;","+        }","+        // An unreadable root manifest fails the root project's own check,","+        // which every install runs, so the error is reported there.","+        let (_, manifest) = pnpm_workspace::try_read_project_manifest(self.root_dir).ok()??;","+        node_version_from_engines_runtime(manifest.value())","+    }","+","+    /// Check the project in `project_dir`, returning the warnings to emit for","+    /// mismatches that do not fail. Its engines and its platform are checked","+    /// apart, so a platform mismatch does not hide an engine failure.","+    pub(crate) fn check(","+        &self,","+        project_dir: &Path,","+        requirements: &PackageInstallabilityManifest,","+    ) -> Result<Vec<LogEvent>, InitStateError> {","+        let engines = PackageInstallabilityManifest {","+            engines: requirements.engines.clone(),","+            ..PackageInstallabilityManifest::default()","+        };","+        let platform = PackageInstallabilityManifest { engines: None, ..requirements.clone() };","+        [engines, platform]","+            .iter()","+            .filter_map(|part| self.check_part(project_dir, part).transpose())","+            .collect()","+    }","+","+    fn check_part(","+        &self,","+        project_dir: &Path,","+        requirements: &PackageInstallabilityManifest,","+    ) -> Result<Option<LogEvent>, InitStateError> {","+        let wanted_engine = requirements.engines.as_ref();","+        let node_version = match wanted_engine.and_then(|engine| engine.node.as_ref()) {","+            Some(_) => self.node_version(),","+            None => \"\",","+        };","+        let pnpm_version =","+            wanted_engine.and_then(|engine| engine.pnpm.as_ref()).map(|_| PNPM_VERSION);","+        let options = InstallabilityOptions {","+            engine_strict: self.config.engine_strict,","+            optional: false,","+            current_node_version: node_version,","+            pnpm_version,","+            current_os: pnpm_graph_hasher::host_platform(),","+            current_cpu: pnpm_graph_hasher::host_arch(),","+            current_libc: pnpm_graph_hasher::host_libc(),","+            supported_architectures: None,","+        };","+        let error = match check_package(&project_dir.to_string_lossy(), requirements, &options) {","+            Ok(None) => return Ok(None),","+            Ok(Some(error)) => error,","+            Err(invalid) => InstallabilityError::InvalidNodeVersion(invalid),","+        };","+        if fails(&error, self.config.engine_strict) {","+            return Err(InitStateError::Installability(Box::new(error)));","+        }","+        Ok(Some(LogEvent::Global(GlobalLog { level: LogLevel::Warn, message: error.to_string() })))","+    }","+","+    /// Check every project in `projects` except the one in the root","+    /// directory, which [`super::check_root_project_engine`] checks. Returns","+    /// the warnings to emit, so that a run that fails emits none.","+    pub(crate) fn check_projects(","+        &self,","+        projects: &[(PathBuf, PackageInstallabilityManifest)],","+    ) -> Result<Vec<LogEvent>, InitStateError> {","+        let root_dir = pnpm_fs::lexical_normalize(self.root_dir);","+        let mut warnings = Vec::new();","+        for (project_dir, requirements) in projects {","+            if pnpm_fs::lexical_normalize(project_dir) == root_dir {","+                continue;","+            }","+            warnings.extend(self.check(project_dir, requirements)?);","+        }","+        Ok(warnings)","+    }","+}","+","+fn fails(error: &InstallabilityError, engine_strict: bool) -> bool {","+    match error {","+        InstallabilityError::Engine(error) => engine_strict || error.wanted.pnpm.is_some(),","+        InstallabilityError::Platform(_) => false,","+        InstallabilityError::InvalidNodeVersion(_) => true,","+    }","+}"],"additions":136,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/install_project_requirements.rs","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,295 @@","+//! An install checking what every workspace project's manifest requires of","+//! the host: its `engines`, `os`, `cpu`, and `libc`.","+","+use crate::{","+    _utils,","+    repeat_install_records::{DECIDED_FROM_RECORDS, traced_install, trust_recorded_stats},","+};","+use assert_cmd::prelude::*;","+use command_extra::CommandExtra;","+use pnpm_testing_utils::bin::{AddMockedRegistry, CommandTempCwd};","+use std::{fs, path::Path, process::Output};","+","+/// A workspace of the root and `packages/app`, whose manifest adds `extra`.","+fn write_workspace(workspace: &Path, extra: &serde_json::Value) {","+    let workspace_yaml = workspace.join(\"pnpm-workspace.yaml\");","+    let mut yaml = fs::read_to_string(&workspace_yaml).unwrap_or_default();","+    yaml.push_str(\"packages:\\n  - packages/*\\n\");","+    fs::write(&workspace_yaml, yaml).expect(\"write pnpm-workspace.yaml\");","+    fs::write(","+        workspace.join(\"package.json\"),","+        serde_json::json!({ \"name\": \"root\", \"private\": true }).to_string(),","+    )","+    .expect(\"write the root package.json\");","+    let mut manifest = serde_json::json!({ \"name\": \"app\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\" });","+    manifest","+        .as_object_mut()","+        .expect(\"an object\")","+        .extend(","+            extra","+                .as_object()","+                .expect(\"an object\")","+                .clone(),","+        );","+    fs::create_dir_all(workspace.join(\"packages/app\")).expect(\"create packages/app\");","+    fs::write(workspace.join(\"packages/app/package.json\"), manifest.to_string())","+        .expect(\"write packages/app/package.json\");","+}","+","+fn output_text(output: &Output) -> String {","+    format!(","+        \"{}{}\",","+        String::from_utf8_lossy(&output.stdout),","+        String::from_utf8_lossy(&output.stderr),","+    )","+}","+","+/// The value of `os` no host matches but this one would.","+fn every_os_but_this_one() -> serde_json::Value {","+    serde_json::json!([format!(\"!{}\", pnpm_graph_hasher::host_platform())])","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn a_workspace_project_with_an_incompatible_pnpm_version_fails() {","+    let CommandTempCwd { pacquet, root, workspace, .. } = CommandTempCwd::init();","+    write_workspace(&workspace, &serde_json::json!({ \"engines\": { \"pnpm\": \">=99.0.0\" } }));","+","+    let output = pacquet","+        .with_args([\"install\", \"--lockfile-only\"])","+        .output()","+        .expect(\"run pnpm install\");","+","+    let text = output_text(&output);","+    assert!(!output.status.success(), \"{text}\");","+    assert!(text.contains(\"ERR_PNPM_UNSUPPORTED_ENGINE\"), \"{text}\");","+    assert!(text.contains(r#\"{\"pnpm\":\">=99.0.0\"}\"#), \"{text}\");","+    assert!(text.contains(\"app\"), \"the error names the project: {text}\");","+    assert!(!workspace.join(\"pnpm-lock.yaml\").exists(), \"{text}\");","+    drop(root);","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn a_workspace_project_node_mismatch_warns_without_engine_strict() {","+    let CommandTempCwd { pacquet, root, workspace, .. } = CommandTempCwd::init();","+    write_workspace(&workspace, &serde_json::json!({ \"engines\": { \"node\": \">=99.0.0\" } }));","+","+    let output = pacquet","+        .with_args([\"install\", \"--lockfile-only\"])","+        .output()","+        .expect(\"run pnpm install\");","+","+    let text = output_text(&output);","+    assert!(output.status.success(), \"{text}\");","+    assert!(text.contains(\"Unsupported engine for\"), \"{text}\");","+    assert!(text.contains(r#\"{\"node\":\">=99.0.0\"}\"#), \"{text}\");","+    drop(root);","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn engine_strict_rejects_a_workspace_project_node_mismatch() {","+    let CommandTempCwd { pacquet, root, workspace, .. } = CommandTempCwd::init();","+    fs::write(workspace.join(\"pnpm-workspace.yaml\"), \"engineStrict: true\\nnodeVersion: 20.0.0\\n\")","+        .expect(\"write workspace settings\");","+    write_workspace(&workspace, &serde_json::json!({ \"engines\": { \"node\": \">=99.0.0\" } }));","+","+    let output = pacquet","+        .with_args([\"install\", \"--lockfile-only\"])","+        .output()","+        .expect(\"run pnpm install\");","+","+    let text = output_text(&output);","+    assert!(!output.status.success(), \"{text}\");","+    assert!(text.contains(\"ERR_PNPM_UNSUPPORTED_ENGINE\"), \"{text}\");","+    assert!(text.contains(r#\"{\"node\":\"20.0.0\"}\"#), \"{text}\");","+    drop(root);","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn a_workspace_project_on_an_unsupported_platform_warns() {","+    let CommandTempCwd { pacquet, root, workspace, .. } = CommandTempCwd::init();","+    fs::write(workspace.join(\"pnpm-workspace.yaml\"), \"engineStrict: true\\n\")","+        .expect(\"write workspace settings\");","+    write_workspace(&workspace, &serde_json::json!({ \"os\": every_os_but_this_one() }));","+","+    let output = pacquet","+        .with_args([\"install\", \"--lockfile-only\"])","+        .output()","+        .expect(\"run pnpm install\");","+","+    let text = output_text(&output);","+    assert!(output.status.success(), \"{text}\");","+    assert!(text.contains(\"Unsupported platform for\"), \"{text}\");","+    drop(root);","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn the_root_project_on_an_unsupported_platform_warns() {","+    let CommandTempCwd { pacquet, root, workspace, .. } = CommandTempCwd::init();","+    fs::write(","+        workspace.join(\"package.json\"),","+        serde_json::json!({ \"name\": \"root\", \"os\": every_os_but_this_one() }).to_string(),","+    )","+    .expect(\"write package.json\");","+","+    let output = pacquet","+        .with_args([\"install\", \"--lockfile-only\"])","+        .output()","+        .expect(\"run pnpm install\");","+","+    let text = output_text(&output);","+    assert!(output.status.success(), \"{text}\");","+    assert!(text.contains(\"Unsupported platform for\"), \"{text}\");","+    drop(root);","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn engine_strict_on_a_repeat_install_rejects_a_workspace_project() {","+    let CommandTempCwd { root, workspace, .. } = CommandTempCwd::init();","+    write_workspace(&workspace, &serde_json::json!({ \"engines\": { \"node\": \">=99.0.0\" } }));","+    _utils::pacquet_in(&workspace)","+        .with_arg(\"install\")","+        .assert()","+        .success();","+","+    let output = _utils::pacquet_in(&workspace)","+        .with_args([\"install\", \"--engine-strict\"])","+        .output()","+        .expect(\"run the repeat install\");","+","+    let text = output_text(&output);","+    assert!(!output.status.success(), \"{text}\");","+    assert!(text.contains(\"ERR_PNPM_UNSUPPORTED_ENGINE\"), \"{text}\");","+    drop(root);","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn a_repeat_install_decided_from_the_records_warns_about_a_workspace_project() {","+    let CommandTempCwd {","+        pacquet,","+        root,","+        workspace,","+        npmrc_info,","+        ..","+    } = CommandTempCwd::init().add_mocked_registry();","+    let AddMockedRegistry { mock_instance, .. } = npmrc_info;","+    write_workspace(&workspace, &serde_json::json!({ \"engines\": { \"node\": \">=99.0.0\" } }));","+    pacquet","+        .with_env(\"PNPM_CONFIG_REGISTRY\", mock_instance.url())","+        .with_arg(\"install\")","+        .assert()","+        .success();","+    trust_recorded_stats(&workspace, mock_instance.url());","+","+    let output = traced_install(&workspace, mock_instance.url());","+","+    assert!(output.contains(DECIDED_FROM_RECORDS), \"{output}\");","+    assert!(output.contains(\"Already up to date\"), \"{output}\");","+    assert!(output.contains(\"Unsupported engine for\"), \"{output}\");","+    drop((root, mock_instance));","+}","+","+/// A record written before the records kept `engines` would stand in for a","+/// manifest without them, so it is not used until a check rewrites it.","+#[test]","+fn a_record_of_an_older_field_revision_is_read_again() {","+    let CommandTempCwd {","+        pacquet,","+        root,","+        workspace,","+        npmrc_info,","+        ..","+    } = CommandTempCwd::init().add_mocked_registry();","+    let AddMockedRegistry { mock_instance, .. } = npmrc_info;","+    write_workspace(&workspace, &serde_json::json!({ \"engines\": { \"node\": \">=99.0.0\" } }));","+    pacquet","+        .with_env(\"PNPM_CONFIG_REGISTRY\", mock_instance.url())","+        .with_arg(\"install\")","+        .assert()","+        .success();","+    trust_recorded_stats(&workspace, mock_instance.url());","+    downgrade_manifest_records(&workspace);","+","+    let from_files = traced_install(&workspace, mock_instance.url());","+    let from_records = traced_install(&workspace, mock_instance.url());","+","+    assert!(!from_files.contains(DECIDED_FROM_RECORDS), \"{from_files}\");","+    assert!(from_files.contains(\"Unsupported engine for\"), \"{from_files}\");","+    assert!(from_records.contains(DECIDED_FROM_RECORDS), \"{from_records}\");","+    assert!(from_records.contains(\"Unsupported engine for\"), \"{from_records}\");","+    drop((root, mock_instance));","+}","+","+/// Make every manifest record look like one 12.18 wrote: no revision and","+/// none of the fields that were added with one.","+fn downgrade_manifest_records(workspace: &Path) {","+    let state_path = workspace.join(\"node_modules/.pnpm-workspace-state-v1.json\");","+    let mut state: serde_json::Value =","+        serde_json::from_str(&fs::read_to_string(&state_path).expect(\"read the state\"))","+            .expect(\"parse the state\");","+    let records = state[\"validation\"][\"manifestFiles\"].as_object_mut().expect(\"manifest records\");","+    for record in records.values_mut() {","+        let record = record.as_object_mut().expect(\"a record\");","+        record.remove(\"fieldsRevision\").expect(\"a fields revision\");","+        let fields = record[\"fields\"].as_object_mut().expect(\"recorded fields\");","+        for field in [\"engines\", \"os\", \"cpu\", \"libc\"] {","+            fields.remove(field);","+        }","+    }","+    fs::write(&state_path, state.to_string()).expect(\"write the state\");","+}","+","+/// A project on an unsupported platform is still held to its `engines`.","+#[test]","+fn a_platform_mismatch_does_not_hide_an_engine_failure() {","+    for in_workspace in [false, true] {","+        let CommandTempCwd { pacquet, root, workspace, .. } = CommandTempCwd::init();","+        let requirements = serde_json::json!({","+            \"os\": every_os_but_this_one(),","+            \"engines\": { \"pnpm\": \">=99.0.0\" },","+        });","+        if in_workspace {","+            write_workspace(&workspace, &requirements);","+        } else {","+            let mut manifest = requirements.clone();","+            manifest[\"name\"] = \"root\".into();","+            fs::write(workspace.join(\"package.json\"), manifest.to_string())","+                .expect(\"write package.json\");","+        }","+","+        let output = pacquet","+            .with_args([\"install\", \"--lockfile-only\"])","+            .output()","+            .expect(\"run pnpm install\");","+","+        let text = output_text(&output);","+        assert!(!output.status.success(), \"in a workspace: {in_workspace}: {text}\");","+        assert!(text.contains(\"ERR_PNPM_UNSUPPORTED_ENGINE\"), \"{text}\");","+        drop(root);","+    }","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn engine_strict_on_a_repeat_install_rejects_a_project_on_an_unsupported_platform() {","+    let CommandTempCwd { root, workspace, .. } = CommandTempCwd::init();","+    write_workspace(","+        &workspace,","+        &serde_json::json!({","+            \"os\": every_os_but_this_one(),","+            \"engines\": { \"node\": \">=99.0.0\" },","+        }),","+    );","+    _utils::pacquet_in(&workspace)","+        .with_arg(\"install\")","+        .assert()","+        .success();","+","+    let output = _utils::pacquet_in(&workspace)","+        .with_args([\"install\", \"--engine-strict\"])","+        .output()","+        .expect(\"run the repeat install\");","+","+    let text = output_text(&output);","+    assert!(!output.status.success(), \"{text}\");","+    assert!(text.contains(\"ERR_PNPM_UNSUPPORTED_ENGINE\"), \"{text}\");","+    drop(root);","+}"],"additions":295,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/main.rs","lines":["@@ -90,6 +90,7 @@ mod injected_deps_with_dedicated_lockfiles;"," mod injected_freshness_matrix;"," mod install;"," mod install_filters;","+mod install_project_requirements;"," mod install_root_engine;"," mod install_runtimes;"," mod install_stale_importers;"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/repeat_install_records.rs","lines":["@@ -15,7 +15,7 @@ use std::{fs, path::Path};"," mod opens;"," "," /// The debug event the fast path logs when the records decided.","-const DECIDED_FROM_RECORDS: &str = \"the recorded manifests decided the install\";","+pub(crate) const DECIDED_FROM_RECORDS: &str = \"the recorded manifests decided the install\";"," "," /// The span that reads the project manifests."," const READ_PROJECTS_SPAN: &str = \"discover_workspace_projects\";","@@ -67,7 +67,7 @@ fn wait_past_whole_second_rounding(workspace: &Path) {"," /// whole seconds. The first install can record the lockfile in the tick it"," /// wrote it, and the next install then rehashes it and writes the state. This"," /// one takes that write, so the state is settled and its records trusted.","-fn trust_recorded_stats(workspace: &Path, registry: &str) {","+pub(crate) fn trust_recorded_stats(workspace: &Path, registry: &str) 